### DoubleGoer::Timing ###
	NotifyTime/EventTime/CloseTime in minutes.

### DoubleGoer::MonsterAI ###
	Unit1-4 - AI unit numbers used for each of the 4 difficulty
	levels (MAX_DG_LEVEL).

### DoubleGoer::MonsterSettings::Monster ###
	One row per difficulty step (0-59, MAX_DG_MONSTER_DIFFICULT):
	  Index          Difficulty step.
	  Level1-5       Monster level multiplier, per tier 1-5.
	  Life1-5        Max life multiplier, per tier.
	  Damage1-5      Damage multiplier, per tier.
	  Defense1-5     Defense multiplier, per tier.
	All values are floats (multipliers), not raw stats.

### DoubleGoer::BreachSettings ###
	Monsters (including the Slaughterer/Mad Slaughterer/Ice Walker
	mini-bosses) walk toward the map's final point; each one that
	reaches it counts as a "breach" and despawns.
	BreachLimit               Breaches allowed before the party fails
	                          the run.
	SlaughtererThreshold      % of event time remaining at or below
	                          which the Slaughterer spawns.
	MadSlaughtererThreshold   % of event time remaining at or below
	                          which the Mad Slaughterer spawns.
	IceWalkerThreshold        % of event time remaining at or below
	                          which the Ice Walker spawns (winning
	                          requires it to never reach the final
	                          point).

### DoubleGoer::DailyEntryLimit ###
	Vip0-3  Maximum number of DoubleGoer entries per day, per VIP tier
	        (AccountLevel 0-3). Resets at midnight (server local time).
	        -1 = unlimited. Kept in memory only - resets if the server
	        restarts.

### DoubleGoer::RewardMode ###
	PartyReward  1 = every party member present gets the Silver/Golden
	             chest reward (fixed default - previously only whoever
	             clicked the single chest NPC first got anything, and
	             it never scaled with party size). 0 = restore the old
	             single physical chest behavior.

STRICTLY NO COMMENTS INSIDE TAGS
-->

